dex":1},{"form_id":"0x000874|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"本当に死んでるのか？何の魔法だ、これは！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000875|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何のためにそんなことをするんだ？ふん。そいつを引っ込めろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000878|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おお！魔法か！ふん。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000879|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ！あの醜い化け物のせいで皆が不安がるぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000877|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死霊術か！恥を知れ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087A|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うーん…このお友達、ぞっとするな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087B|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その魔法には気をつけたほうがいいぞ…身のためを思うならな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087C|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死んでるのか？マラキャスにかけて、何の魔法だ、これは？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087D|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔法か…結構なことだ。お前のような輩はお呼びじゃない。今すぐ出て行け。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087E|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔術師の小細工か！魔法は弱者のものだ。お前は弱い！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00087F|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何…？近寄るな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000880|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あっちへ行け。今すぐ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000881|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死んでるのか？何の魔法だ、これは？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000882|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"神々よ！あいつ…死んでるのか？気持ち悪い！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000883|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死んでるのか？何の魔法だ、これは！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000884|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"皆が不安がってる。だから…頼むから…出て行ってくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000886|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おおお、気味の悪い奴だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000885|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔法か…気持ち悪い。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088A|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この…ふん…「お友達」とやらはぞっとする。距離を取ってくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000887|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、魔法なんてのはエルフやひ弱な種族のためのもんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000888|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、魔法なんてのはエルフやひ弱な種族のためのもんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000889|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、魔法なんてのはエルフやひ弱な種族のためのもんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00080B|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"誰かあの忌々しい魔術師に矢をぶち込んでやれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000817|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"空気に不自然な冷たさがある…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000821|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そいつのせいで…皆が不安がってる。忌々しい魔術師め！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000824|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"神々よ！世の中どうなってるんだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C4|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"忌々しい魔術師め。やめろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C3|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ご大層な魔法なら、どこか他所で使ってくれ。不自然だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C2|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"神々よ。世の中どうなってるんだ？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C1|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"そいつをここから連れ出せ。今すぐだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000DEF|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"あの…化け物！不自然だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00082F|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ふん、忌々しい魔術師どもと、その忌々しい魔法め！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000851|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うわっ！何だ…？神々よ！何と言えばいいのかもわからない！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000863|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔法なら若い頃に散々見てきた。近づかないのが一番だってことくらい知ってる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000868|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この辺りに死霊術師がいる。気をつけろ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B7|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の魔法だ？近寄るな。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B8|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うわっ！死体だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008B9|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の魔法だ、これは？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BA|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ…？イスグラモルが見たら恥じるぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BB|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"頼む、その魔法を近づけないでくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BC|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どう見ても死んでるな。本当に胸糞悪い！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BD|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"神々よ！なんて下品な見せ物だ…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BE|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"その呪文は危なそうだ。離れていてくれ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008BF|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の魔法だ、これは！？ひどすぎる！あっちへ行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C0|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死んでる！？何の魔法だ、これは？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C5|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔法か。邪悪な魔法だ！顔に書いてあるぞ。あっちへ行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C6|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気味が悪いったらないよ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C7|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"もういい加減にしろ。魔法は控えておけ。皆が不安がってる。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C8|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の魔法だ？どう見ても死んでるぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008C9|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ちょっと気味が悪いな。近寄らないでくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CE|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"胸糞悪い！その腐った死骸を近づけるな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CA|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ん！？何の魔法だ、これは！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CB|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"お前のような輩の居場所はここにはない！今すぐ出て行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CC|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"いいとも！精霊を召喚して大騒ぎを起こせばいいさ。ああ、実に名案だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CD|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"狼か。面白い。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008CF|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の魔法だ？近寄るな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D0|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"気持ち悪い。あっちへ行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D1|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うわっ！死体だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D2|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の魔法だ？近寄るな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D3|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめろ！あんたは歓迎されてない！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D4|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ…！？こんな状態で放っておくな、恥知らずめ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D5|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔法か？あまり感心しないな…","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D7|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"し…死んでる！？ひどすぎる！あっちへ行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D8|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"し…死んでるのか！？不自然だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008D9|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何の魔法だ？ああ、最高だ。頭のおかしい魔術師に殺されちまう！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DA|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"炎の精霊か。見事だ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DB|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"酔ってるのか？きっと酔ってるんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DC|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死んでる！何の魔法だ、これは！？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DD|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"双子月にかけて！どうやったんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DF|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、魔法なんてのはエルフやひ弱な種族のためのもんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E0|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、魔法なんてのはエルフやひ弱な種族のためのもんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E1|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔法か…気持ち悪い。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E2|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"この…ふん…「お友達」とやらはぞっとする。距離を取ってくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E3|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"ああ、魔法なんてのはエルフやひ弱な種族のためのもんだ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E4|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おおお、気味の悪い奴だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E5|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"皆が不安がってる。だから…頼むから…出て行ってくれ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E6|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"魔術師の小細工か！魔法は弱者のものだ。お前は弱い！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E7|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"おお！魔法か！ふん。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E8|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"まあ！あの醜い化け物のせいで皆が不安がるぞ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008E9|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死霊術か！恥を知れ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EA|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死んでる。死んでるんだ！神々よ、お助けを！近寄るな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EB|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"死霊術師か、うっ！同族の恥さらしめ！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EC|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"どう見ても死んでるな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008ED|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"汚らわしい死霊術師め！近寄るな！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008EE|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"うわっ！死霊術だ！恥を知れ！あっちへ行け！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x0008DE|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"何だ…？やめろ！今すぐ！！","index":1},{"form_id":"0x00088E|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめてもらおうか！誰も騙されちゃいないぞ。これが最後の警告だ。","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000892|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"皆が不安がってる。やめてもらおうか。今すぐだ！わかったか？","index":1},{"form_id":"0x000895|npcs react to necromancy.esp","type":"INFO NAM1","string":"やめてもらおうか！皆が不安がってる！わかったか